# dist/e2e/ is the e2e spec output (tsconfig.e2e.json). dist/test/ and
# dist/test-e2e/ are what plain `tsc -p tsconfig.json` (rootDir src) wrote before
# that config became noEmit -- no build produces them any more, but a stale tree
# can still sit on an existing checkout, and a stale one ships if not ignored.
# All dev-only.
